section R05Seg7
/-! # ATLAS-V-01 summary statements

Three packaged statements of the V-01 block (each is a conjunction of theorems proved in `KNFrame`, `KNFaraday`,
`ModeOperators`; nothing new is assumed). `a = 0` and `Q = 0` are allowed in `v01_frame` and `v01_faraday`; III's
`Hintz2026.SubextremalKN p` (`M > 0`, `Q ≠ 0`, `a² + Q² < M²`) enters only in `v01_modes`. -/

open Real
open scoped ComplexConjugate Matrix ContDiff
open ExactVacuumAtlas.EinsteinMaxwell.KN (gKN giKN faradayKN domReg domKN)

namespace ExactVacuumAtlas.EinsteinMaxwell.NP

end ExactVacuumAtlas.EinsteinMaxwell.NP
end R05Seg7

-- ==== solution ====
open Real
open scoped ComplexConjugate Matrix ContDiff
open ExactVacuumAtlas.EinsteinMaxwell.KN (gKN giKN faradayKN domReg domKN)
open ExactVacuumAtlas
open ExactVacuumAtlas.EinsteinMaxwell
open ExactVacuumAtlas.EinsteinMaxwell.NP
theorem solution (M a Q : ℝ) :
    IsOpen (domReg M a Q) ∧ (domReg M a Q).Nonempty ∧
    (∀ A μ : Fin 4, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => knFrame M a Q x A μ) (domReg M a Q)) ∧
    ∀ x ∈ domReg M a Q,
      (knT M a Q x)ᵀ * cmat (gKN M a Q) x * knT M a Q x = etaNull ∧
      (∀ μ, knMbar a x μ = conj (knM a x μ)) ∧
      knDual M a Q x * knT M a Q x = 1 ∧ knT M a Q x * knDual M a Q x = 1 ∧
      knT M a Q x * etaNull * (knT M a Q x)ᵀ = cmat (giKN M a Q) x ∧
      (knDual M a Q x)ᵀ * etaNull * knDual M a Q x = cmat (gKN M a Q) x :=
  ⟨KN.isOpen_domReg M a Q, KN.domReg_nonempty M a Q, contDiffOn_knFrame M a Q, fun _ hx =>
    ⟨gram_matrix hx, fun μ => congrFun (knMbar_eq_conj a _) μ, knDual_mul_knT hx, knT_mul_knDual hx,
      inverse_metric hx, metric_reconstruction hx⟩⟩
